# Covers the hand-written oracle-side C (factory/ and spike/ under
# benchmarks/): plain upstream LLVM style, deliberately untuned.
# Generated C under gen/ is equality-guarded, never formatted.
# Note LLVM style sorts includes — guard order-sensitive includes
# (BPF headers) with "// clang-format off/on" markers at the site.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
